# An AdaRace road.  One setting a line, then the points it runs through, closed
# back to the first: x  z  height  half-width  banking (metres, degrees; banking
# is positive when the right side is lower).  See "Your own roads" in the README.
name Monte Ferro
kind circuit
# A narrow mountain circuit, blind crests and a run down through the woods
points
